     :statement
     "The parser-RQ site descriptor declares exactly three runtime places — `evidence_store_root`, `scratch_root`, and `campaign_lock_path` — at schema version `3.0.0`. It declares no corpus locator, and a descriptor carrying one is rejected by the closed contract rather than accepted and ignored, because no capture ever read corpus bytes from it. Evidence boundary: `test/abc/tools/validate_design_bundle_test.clj`.",
